invalid type: string "## Image content\n\n**Title:** Revenue Overview  \n**Subtitle:** Revenue compared to previous Year\n\n### Chart type\n- Grouped vertical bar chart.\n- Categories: **JAN, FEB, MRC, APR, MAY, JUN**\n- Y-axis labels: **10.000, 20.000, 30.000, 40.000, 50.000**\n- Each month has two bars:\n  - Light green bar\n  - Dark green bar\nuage barriers, keep the message. |\na boolean03 Kč